    gist: 'Sa Chluastuiscint (60 marc) you hear Fógraí, Comhráite and Píosaí THREE times each — use the gaps. (1) Roimh an éisteacht: read each question and underline the question word — Cén fáth? (why), Cé mhéad? (how much/many), Cén áit? (where), Cén t-ainm? (what name) — so you know exactly what to listen for. (2) Listen 1: catch the gist. (3) Listen 2: write the answer. (4) Listen 3: check spelling. Bí cúramach faoin gcanúint — the speakers use Canúint Uladh, Chonnacht agus na Mumhan, so the same word can sound different. You answer in short Irish phrases, NOT full essays.',
