      needed: ['At least 3 sentences all kept in ONE tense (aimsir chaite)', 'A sequence/time phrase (e.g. Maidin amháin, Ansin, Ina dhiaidh sin)', 'Correct verb forms incl. an irregular if used (chonaic, chuaigh, etc.)', 'A richer phrase / nath cainte for saibhreas (e.g. baineadh geit as)'],
