      modelAnswer: 'Tá mé i mo chónaí i mbaile beag faoin tuath. Is maith liom a bheith i mo chónaí ann mar tá sé ciúin agus tá aithne agam ar gach duine. Tá siopaí, club spóirt agus páirc dheas in aice liom. Áfach, ba mhaith liom bogadh go dtí an chathair amach anseo le bheith níos cóngaraí don ollscoil. (I live in a small town in the country. I like living there because it\'s quiet and I know everyone. There are shops, a sports club and a nice park near me. However, I\'d like to move to the city in future to be closer to the university — note the reason \'mar…\', the listed detail for richness, and \'ba mhaith liom\' for a future plan.)',
