      modelAnswer: '(i) Bhí níos mó ná 80,000 duine i bPáirc an Chrócaigh nuair a chuir Ed Sheeran tús lena chamchuairt dhomhanda i mí Aibreáin. (ii) Bhí scoth an cheoil le cloisteáil agus bhí atmaisféar dochreidte sa staid. (There were more than 80,000 people in Croke Park when Ed Sheeran began his world tour in April; the best of music could be heard and there was an incredible atmosphere in the stadium.)',
