    source: 'LC Business Unit 1: People in Business — Elements of Contract Law. Marking scheme 2025 HL Q1(A) (Consideration, Capacity to Contract, Consent to Contract, Legality of form: 4@5 (4+1),(4+1),(3+2),(3+2), command words Explain + Example, \'Example required\' under each); also marking scheme 2023 HL Q1(C) (Consideration / Legality of Form / Intention to Contract, 2@8(4+4),1@4(2+2)) and 2024 OL (Explain three elements of a legal contract: Consideration / Capacity / Consent / Legality of Purpose, 4+3,4+3,4+2)',
