    source: 'Grammaire — L\'accord. Grounded in LC French Ordinary Level marking scheme 2024, Expression Écrite Language band (\'verb endings, agreements, tenses nearly always correct\'); the \'Filling Gaps\' exercise (Q.1(a)) and its letter passage, which contains \'une grande variété\' and \'ma grand-mère\'. The HL 2024 scheme\'s grammar-waiver note (Appendix 1) penalises \'mon\' before a feminine noun.',
