    focus: 'L\'opinion / réaction au stimulus (HL Q1)', level: 'higher',
    gist: 'The HL Section B opinion piece (Q1, ~90 mots, 60 marks) reacts to a quote or image from the Section A reading. The marking grid splits it 50/50: Communication = 30 (did you exploit the stimulus, stay coherent, fulfil the communicative intention, hold the right register) and Language = 30 (idiomatic French, rich vocabulary, complex sentences well handled, few mistakes in verbs/agreement/spelling). Structure it: (1) state your position — « Selon moi… » / « Je suis tout à fait d\'accord… » (in my view / I completely agree); (2) give TWO reasons with examples — « D\'une part… d\'autre part… » (on one hand… on the other…); (3) conclude — « En conclusion, je pense que… ». You MUST give your own opinion, not just retell the text — the grid scores \'mere transcription of the stimulus material\' in the BOTTOM Communication band.',
