    source: 'Organic Chemistry 7.5 Chromatography - SEC LC Chemistry 2022 Ordinary Level Q8(c) (marking scheme: (c)(i) S above solvent so sample not washed into solvent (7); (c)(iv) direction P: up, T: up, C: down (3); (c)(iii) stationary phase T/C = silica (SiO2) / alumina (Al2O3) (6))',
