      modelAnswer: '(i) Net force = forward - opposing = 680 - 520 = 160 N to the right. (ii) a = F/m = 160/1900 = 0.084 m s^-2. (iii) v = u + at = 20 + (0.084)(12) = 20 + 1.01 = 21 m s^-1 (to the right).',
      needed: ['net force = 680 - 520 = 160 N (subtract opposing force first)', 'a = F/m = 160/1900 = 0.084 m s^-2 (use the NET force, not 680 N)', 'v = u + at = 20 + 0.084 * 12 = 21 m s^-1'],
