      modelAnswer: '(i) Resonance is the transfer of energy between two bodies (or systems) that have the same natural frequency. (ii) Use c = f*lambda, so lambda = c/f = 336/320 = 1.05 m. (iii) length = lambda/4 = 1.05/4 = 0.2625 m, i.e. about 0.26 m. (The closed end is a node and the open end an antinode, so only a quarter wavelength fits the pipe at the fundamental.)',
