    source: 'Topic Crops: Plant Physiology (photosynthesis) - SEC LC Agricultural Science 2022 Ordinary Level, Q7(b)(i)-(ii) + marking scheme (A = carbon dioxide; B = oxygen; C = glucose; leaf flat/large surface area, thin, stomata for gas exchange)',
