    source: 'Topic: Written production note — SEC LC Spanish 2025 OL, Section B Q2(a) Note (20 marks, 4 points x 5m; cues \'Say you are going to the city centre by bus\' / \'Ask if she would like to go to the cinema with you at 8pm\') + marking scheme (5 marks = \'Message fully conveyed, no grammatical errors\')',
