      text: 'Copy only the matching word/phrase verbatim. The scheme states \'No marks awarded if extra words are added. Exact transcription required.\' For \'recuperado\' write exactly \'restablecido\' — not \'me sentía restablecido\' (extra words = 0) and not \'restablecida\' (wrong ending). Lift the precise form the text uses, with every accent.',
