      text: 'Give three separate, paraphrased interpretive points (4m each). For \'hope vs despair\' you might write: (1) his hope shows when he keeps making efforts to save himself; (2) despair shows when he expects to die of hunger and thirst; (3) hope returns as his wounds heal and he feels himself again. Each in your own words — the moment you copy/translate a phrase from the extract to \'prove\' it, the scheme awards 0 for that point.',
