      modelAnswer: 'Point (own words): \'He rejects the hero label because, in his view, surviving was simply about not letting himself die of hunger and thirst — an instinct, not a brave choice.\' It must be paraphrased because the scheme states \'[No marks awarded for answers supported by reference to the extract]\', so copying or translating a line like \'no haberme dejado morir de hambre\' to back it up would score 0 for that point.',
