    gist: 'The 2023 OL Q1 1:5 section was a 400 mm full-fill insulated cavity block wall (plastered both sides) carrying a suspended timber first floor. The 225 mm x 50 mm joists are hung off the inner leaf on metal JOIST HANGERS; the floor is tongued-and-grooved hardwood on 20 mm plywood decking with a plasterboard ceiling beneath. Each named, sized detail scores 5 marks (any 7 details = 35), and part (b) gives 3 marks for clearly showing the WALL TIE that connects the inner and outer leaves.',
