      needed: ['1.5 mm² cable; Live brown, Neutral blue, Earth green-and-yellow', '6 A RCBO (protective device) so the circuit can be isolated / trips on fault', 'Switch breaks the live (phase) conductor and an earth is provided to lights and switch'],
