    source: 'Topic 3.3 Impact and Value — SEC LC Art (Visual Studies) 2025 Higher Level, Section A, Q3 + marking scheme (\'artistic criteria... to be included in an artist-in-residence programme\'; \'how a residency benefits the career of an artist\')',
