    gist: 'Written Production is marked on Content AND Expression equally (e.g. Schriftliche Produktion = Content 25 + Expression 25). The Expression grid penalises \'word order, esp. verb position\' and rewards \'few word order mistakes\'. German\'s iron rule is V2: in a normal statement the conjugated verb is the SECOND element. So when you start a sentence with a time word or phrase, the SUBJECT moves AFTER the verb (inversion): \'Am Wochenende GEHE ich ins Kino\' (At the weekend I go to the cinema) — NOT \'Am Wochenende ich gehe...\'. This single habit moves your Expression into a higher band.',
