    source: 'Topic: Particle Motion in 2D — SEC LC Applied Mathematics 2023 HL, Q8(i) + marking scheme (38 sin 41°(3) − ½g(3)² = u sin 64°(2) − ½g(2)²; u = 27.98 m s⁻¹)',
