    source: 'Topic: geometric recurrences and interpreting terms — SEC LC Applied Mathematics 2023 OL, Q1(b) + marking scheme (M₃ = 1.56, M₄ = 1.43; M₆ = 1.21 so 0.79 kg lost; ln0.5/ln0.92 = 8.31 so n = 9)',
