      modelAnswer: '(i) Use v = rω → 1 = 2ω → ω = 1/2 = 0.5 rad s⁻¹. (ii) ω is the same for the whole turntable (0.5 rad s⁻¹). At r = 1 m: v = rω = 1 × 0.5 = 0.5 m s⁻¹. Since 0.5 m s⁻¹ < 1 m s⁻¹, the closer rider is SLOWER, so the claim is incorrect. (iii) a = v²/r = (1)²/2 = 0.5 m s⁻². (iv) F = ma = 25 × 0.5 = 12.5 N (directed toward the centre).',
