      needed: ['Gives TWO distinct, valid checks (e.g. credibility of the author/organisation, cross-checking against other reliable sources, checking the date/currency, distinguishing fact from bias/satire/propaganda)', 'Explains what each check tells you about the source\'s trustworthiness, not just names it', 'Frames it as helping a young person decide whether to trust/share the information'],
