      modelAnswer: 'Teideal: \'Lá dochreidte i bPáirc an Chrócaigh!\' — \'A chairde, an raibh sibh riamh ag Cluiche Ceannais na hÉireann? Bhí mise ann i mí Mheán Fómhair agus ní dhéanfaidh mé dearmad go deo air.\' Register choice: a headline-style title and a direct address to the school readership (\'A chairde... an raibh sibh...\') — a diary would open with a date and \'A dhialann dhil\' and would never speak to readers.',
      needed: ['A title/headline suited to a school magazine', 'An opening that hooks or addresses readers — NOT a date + \'A dhialann dhil\' diary opening', 'Names the register signal explicitly and contrasts it with the wrong genre'],
