      modelAnswer: 'A Liam, an bhfuair tú an scéal? Beidh ceolchoirm ar siúl i Halla na Scoile Dé hAoine, an 26 Meitheamh. Tosóidh sí ar a hocht a chlog. Ar mhaith leat teacht liom? Beidh an-chraic ann! Slán go fóill, Aoife. (All four notice facts — event, venue, day/date, time — plus a direct invitation question, inside a greeting/sign-off message frame.)',
      needed: ['All four fógra facts appear: ceolchoirm, Halla na Scoile, Dé hAoine an 26 Meitheamh, ar a hocht a chlog (8.00 p.m.)', 'A direct invitation sentence: \'Ar mhaith leat teacht liom?\' / \'An dtiocfaidh tú liom?\'', 'Message shape: a greeting (A Liam, ...) and a sign-off (Slán, ...)'],
