    source: 'Topic Summary statistics (averages & spread) — SEC JC Maths 2024 OL, Q8(b) + marking scheme (Scale 10D; mean 2279/12 = 189.9 accept 190; median (189+190)/2 = 189.5; range 200 - 179 = 21; LPC for relevant addition or numbers identified)',
