      label: '\'Computer games only\' = (computer-games total) - (both)',
      text: 'If 48 play computer games and 30 play both, then computer-games-only = 48 - 30 = 18 (do not use 48). For \'one but not both\', add the two \'only\' regions: 35 (sport only) + 18 (games only) = 53, over the total 120, giving 53/120. Leaving the answer as \'(35+18)/120\' without computing it is flagged for Full Credit -1, so finish to a single fraction or decimal.',
