      modelAnswer: '(a) Computer games only = 48 - 30 = 18. (b) Add the regions inside the circles: 35 (sport only) + 30 (both) + 18 (games only) = 83. Neither = 120 - 83 = 37. (c) \'Sport or computer games but not both\' = the two non-overlap regions = 35 + 18 = 53. P = 53/120.',
