      modelAnswer: 'Yes, it is a testable hypothesis. It is testable because it makes a clear prediction (green balls bounce higher than orange balls) that you could check by dropping green and orange tennis balls from the same height and measuring how high each one bounces — so the experiment could either support it or show it to be false.',
      needed: ['States \'Yes\' (it is a testable hypothesis)', 'Justifies it: you could test/measure it by experiment (e.g. drop both colours from the same height and measure the bounce height) so it can be supported or disproved'],
