      text: 'Work each month in order: total the payments, do net cash = receipts − payments (bracket = minus), then closing cash = opening + net cash. Then carry that closing figure into the next month as its opening cash. Forgetting to carry the closing balance forward is the single biggest mark-loss in a cash-flow/budget question.',
