      modelAnswer: 'JUNE: Total payments = 172 + 450 + 20 = €642. Net cash = receipts − payments = 400 − 642 = (€242), a deficit. Closing cash = opening + net cash = 175 + (242) = (€67). JULY: Opening cash = June\'s closing cash = (€67). Total payments = 58 + 26 = €84. Net cash = 600 − 84 = €516. Closing cash = (67) + 516 = €449.',
