    gist: 'The marketing mix is the 4 Ps: Product (what is sold + its design/quality/brand/packaging), Price (what the customer pays + the pricing strategy), Place (how/where it gets to the customer - shops, online, distribution channel), Promotion (how the business tells customers about it - advertising, social media, sales promotion). Every marketing decision belongs to ONE of these four. In a \'complete the marketing mix\' or \'which element is this\' question you must name the correct P, not just describe the activity.',
